  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 12 + 12 − 4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 22\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1): ÷ and +\n\n12 + 12 − 4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 22 ⇒ 12 ÷ 12 − 4 × 4 + 2 = 22\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷**____** 12**__ − 4 × 4 + 2 = 22\n\n⇒ 1 − __**4 × 4**__ + 2 = 22\n\n⇒ __**1 + 2**__ − 16 = 22\n\n⇒ 3 − 16 = 22\n\n⇒ -13 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): ÷ and −\n\n12 + 12 − 4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 22 ⇒ 12 + 12 ÷ 4 × 4 - 2 = 22\n\n⇒ 12 + __**12 **____**÷**____** 4**__ × 4 - 2 = 22\n\n⇒ 12 + __**3**____** × 4**__ - 2 = 22\n\n⇒ __**12 + 12**__ - 2 = 22\n\n⇒ __**2**____**4 - 2**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 22 = 22 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3): − and +\n\n12 + 12 − 4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 22 ⇒ 12 - 12 + 4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 22\n\n⇒ 12 - 12 + 4 × __**4 ÷ 2**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 12 - 12 + __**4 × 2**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __**12 + 8**__ - 12 = 22\n\n⇒ __20** - 12**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): × and −\n\n12 + 12 − 4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 22 ⇒ 12 + 12 × 4 - 4 ÷ 2 = 22\n\n⇒ 12 + 12 × 4 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 12 + __**12 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 2 = 22\n\n⇒ __**12 + 48**__ - 2 = 22\n\n⇒ __**60**____** - 2**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 58 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
